{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "ea28e9b8b50297c97237d78709baf48cd68fa9d3d73419645f6e23f1a74594f7", "ja": "あ、歌織さん！　ここにいたんですね。\n星梨花、話してるところ悪いけど……ちょっといい？", "zh": "啊，歌织姊！原来你在这里。\n星梨花，不好意思打扰你们谈话……我可以问点事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6cbfc86ca02b9336b36a603ab210123b5eeab329bed2a114af63d5241ea8961", "ja": "静香さん、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "静香姊姊，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "08fc9a8d753e52a8ef1a0f712319cd3d97fc6738b907ca26a43026b5fb32d7fb", "ja": "レッスンの課題曲で、掴めないところがあるの。\n歌織さんに相談したくて……いいですか？　歌織さん。", "zh": "训练课程的课题曲，我有个地方掌握不到要点，\n想找你商量一下……可以吗，歌织姊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "4895f8066f93406429503d805019b8fa877824c9d31c2ebb802f57be41a104bf", "ja": "もちろんよ、静香ちゃん！\n私で力になれることなら、なんでも言ってね。", "zh": "当然可以了，静香！\n只要是我能帮上忙的，你尽管问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "38db4af838e34579172021ed1cd5c189bb728e79e791c449dfca25df719af168", "ja": "歌織さん、お疲れさまです！\nちょっとお話が……。", "zh": "歌织小姐，辛苦了！\n有件事想跟你说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "bbd49884b810e7f6c3b45e36387343ccc8280afa3896aae82b260b8c520f1d76", "ja": "{$P$}？\n今私が話してるのに……邪魔しないでください。", "zh": "{$P$}？\n我正在和歌织姊说话……请你不要打扰我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "91eaed72fe477f01fe2bda68f086365273fca82d0335f70ab66a12a157f7751b", "ja": "あ、ゴメン……お先にどうぞ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉……你们先聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "f4ff0ffb073285bd232c70c6b44fe1d7589f6eb2aebd5810df4489700f1b5b5b", "ja": "歌織さん、大人気ですね♪", "zh": "歌织姊姊好受欢迎喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "b32fd4d74e44c19b905706ed842cba4e443140404d4e7e04cf168fcf97ecfeda", "ja": "もう、星梨花ちゃんったら。\nじゃあ、静香ちゃんの課題曲……あ、でも……。", "zh": "讨厌啦，星梨花真是的。\n那静香的课题曲……啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "9d2a0ed27c7980124ae670552868e587a7acfa8e8969cd9f72f839744a2b9790", "ja": "静香ちゃん、やっぱり待ってもらってもいい？\n歌の相談は、しっかり時間をとりたいから……ね？", "zh": "静香，还是请你先等一下可以吗？\n因为我想好好花时间跟你讨论歌曲的问题……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "27409aa64b5535fd4a8743daff8faa9b6a7f404cecefd668e77e40413318cb4e", "ja": "まあ、歌織さんがそう言うなら……。\n早くしてくださいね、{$P$}。", "zh": "既然歌织姊都这么说了……\n请你快一点喔，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e02856448137aa656e51cf308dd6b98d7ab2f9b0fb8a54df2ead62d3b8008a8d", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。\nじゃあ、かいつまんで話しますね。", "zh": "哈哈，我知道啦，\n那我就长话短说啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1012_p", "source_sha256": "faeb73265648fe2f3fea762f38e6e1cf7658c94da2e8559612564b9daf945a70", "ja": "今さっき、歌織さんの新曲が上がってきました。\n今度の公演でお披露目してもらえませんか？", "zh": "歌织小姐的新歌刚才完成了。\n可不可以请你在这次公演进行首演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "9f60f2b518bb55fc2c12de43d03185a87d0ea99388682ff0e95ecada4729cdd3", "ja": "私の新曲ですか……。\nえっ、私の新曲ですか！？", "zh": "我的新歌啊……\n咦，我的新歌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "f6824ac8a87734ae22f4faefacd3cdae10c6634a173b73d0e209df8f62ec46a1", "ja": "わぁ、すごいです！\nおめでとうございます、歌織さん♪", "zh": "哇～好棒！\n恭喜你，歌织姊姊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0b96fcf202f04ed1534144be825c600a28602a2a2048e6ba37967235bb4c0be", "ja": "{$P$}、そういうことなら、\nもっと早く言ってください、もう！", "zh": "{$P$}，如果是这种事，\n拜托你早点说啦，真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "110a27c2ba70537eeebb7725559029ef7bb157eeaf749469f8bd9b9246bdf3c1", "ja": "歌織さん、私も嬉しいです。歌織さんの新しい歌が\n聞けるんですから。……ね、星梨花？", "zh": "歌织姊，我也很高兴，因为可以听到歌织姊的新歌……\n对不对，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "9246d017a95276d86e8abe175e096a6e3148496dc223ce80d1f09c79d5b70d92", "ja": "はい、とっても楽しみです！\nわたしも歌織さんの歌、大好きです♪", "zh": "对啊，好期待！\n我也最喜欢听歌织姊姊唱歌了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "bfa001346498a4279b77e88f37170d5b273f4ce821695742e5caf1bcc68e019c", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、静香ちゃんも……ありがとう。\nそんな風に言われたら、嬉しいけど……恥ずかしいわ。", "zh": "星梨花、静香……谢谢你们。\n你们这么说让我很高兴……但也好害羞啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4385a92fd4fa380085db48a84489950422247f3e65e9e014a978aefe804bd0f4", "ja": "でも、俺も二人と同じ気持ちですよ。\n歌織さんのステージ、とっても楽しみです。", "zh": "我的想法也跟她们两人一样，\n我很期待歌织小姐的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "60537acf80d49d94000f8b9a46983e53be2c6c5afcebb985e7d7957155ae144b", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さんまで……。", "zh": "真是的，连{$P$}先生都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a1d90ff65e12ec07d32b96c8c6d052c57b93920ffa36a508b6a180401990a5aa", "ja": "どうですか、歌織さん。\n新曲のお披露目公演、引き受けてもらえますか？", "zh": "你觉得如何，歌织小姐？\n你愿意接下新歌首演的公演任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "09eb47c77e804de84a0734a4cc85bda6a2b963f9b7262b652013c8aea319f557", "ja": "それは……ふふっ、わざわざ確かめるなんて。\nいじわるなんですね。", "zh": "这……呵呵，竟然还故意问我，\n你很坏心眼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_044_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "6afed51ab7d7a036a2dbcd7f8340857512ddd8cdc8872d1a13949e41e9f39bdb", "ja": "もちろん、喜んでお引き受けいたします♪\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我当然乐意接下了♪\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
